      "role": "实地考察",
      "time": "2005–2008",
      "is_op": true,
      "images": [
        "images/1-0-200498225345.jpg"
      ],
      "content": "<div class=\"abbs-post-photo-wrap\">\n  <img src=\"images/1-0-200498225345.jpg\" class=\"abbs-post-photo\" alt=\"瑞峰院波涛砂纹 · 怒涛翻滚的动态凝固\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-weight:600; margin-top:12px; color:var(--text-primary);\">瑞峰院波涛砂纹 · 怒涛翻滚的动态凝固</p>\n<p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7;\">以高低起伏的白砂堆叠象征怒涛翻滚的大海，景石宛若激浪中的仙岛。</p>"
    },
